 SPECIFICATIONS LISTED IN THE PLANS AND CHANGES USTED IN THE PROPOSAL SHALL GOVERN THIS IMPROVEMENT.", "bbox": {"x": 4892.441838836465, "y": 1858.8764051479445, "width": 1344.18608878822, "height": 217.52809047698983}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "I HEREBY APPROVE THESE PLANS AND DECLARE THAT THE MAKING OF THIS IMPROVEMENT WILL NOT REQUIRE THE CLOSING TO TRAFFIC OF THE HIGHWAY AND THAT PROVISIONS FOR THE MANTENANCE AND SAFETY OF TRAFFIC WILL BE AS SET FORTH ON THE PLANS AND ESTIMATES.", "bbox": {"x": 4892.44184859218, "y": 2185.1685424708344, "width": 1443.0232785782723, "height": 227.41572856903076}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "JohnathonE. Smith", "bbox": {"x": 4901.169938890249, "y": 2570.959732157153, "width": 634.5486499549886, "height": 79.59806203842143}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Johnathon E. Smith", "bbox": {"x": 4902.325580088152, "y": 2649.1666661006366, "width": 345.9302341841626, "height": 50.416666666666245}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Joseph D. Directer", "bbox": {"x": 4902.325592085647, "y": 2786.666668826962, "width": 681.9767214217269, "height": 91.66666666666683}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Director, Department of Transportation", "bbox": {"x": 4892.441876209672, "y": 2914.999999743169, "width": 731.3953163167538, "height": 51.29213571548501}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "02-31", "bbox": {"x": 2036.0465122516116, "y": 3500.224718163449, "width": 108.72092799677655, "height": 49.43820357322713}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "6P-41", "bbox": {"x": 2036.0465121417926, "y": 3547.4999995780063, "width": 108.72092799677655, "height": 51.60112440586051}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "6P-51", "bbox": {"x": 2036.0465116119587, "y": 3597.91666676082, "width": 118.60464872375651, "height": 50.62265694141388}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "066-4.4", "bbox": {"x": 2036.046513772694, "y": 3747.415731035595, "width": 128.4883694507361, "height": 49.438199202219614}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MGS-31", "bbox": {"x": 2036.0465115681188, "y": 3945.1685402303506, "width": 138.372